s/2206000/extras/9de84b6a7fec6888af367cb1b014cf7c.webm?t=1692906324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206000/extras/9de84b6a7fec6888af367cb1b014cf7c.mp4?t=1692906324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5 different spaceships with different abilities<br></li><li> Special weapons for maximum destruction<br></li><li> Unique planets<br></li><li> Retro synthwave tracks<br></li><li> Retro-space atmosphere<br></li><li> You get a complete game as in old days! No in-game transactions or DLCs.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206000/extras/8488b6ee83396a26a22acede54a5bd25.poster.avif?t=1692906324\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206000/extras/8488b6ee83396a26a22acede54a5bd25.webm?t=1692906324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206000/extras/8488b6ee83396a26a22acede54a5bd25.mp4?t=1692906324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
